  "b8bce9d3-6a46-443c-acc5-92374653c479"],
 " under the full count."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b9da0cdb-76e5-467c-afa5-a50478a28541"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
